  message: "Fixed in PR #3283 (commit 5dbf642fa). Python analyzer now emits module_attr_ref edges for imported-module attribute reads; tag_io_boundaries tags them as env_read when they match attributes: entries in the YAML catalog. Self-analysis probe went from 0 → 4 module_attr_ref edges. Scope: Python only — WI-gapam covers the 12 tree-sitter-based analyzers via a base-class helper."  # 1170
